Suddenly, Doyle grabs your shoulder and sinks silently on the ground. His face turned pale, the eyes rolled up. You barely manage to hold him and he collapses on your hands.
"Doyle, Doyle!" you slap him on the cheeks, trying to revive your friend.
At least you see, that he is alive, one could hear him breath and wheeze slightly. You put him down carefully, and think desperately what to do.